{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10261","headline":"送萧颖士赴东府得还字 · 房白","name":"送萧颖士赴东府得还字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夫子高世蹟，时人不可攀。\n今予亦云幸，谬得承温颜。\n良策资入幕，遂行从近关。\n青春灞亭别，此去何时还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}